## Portrait assets are not distributed

This repository contains **no portrait images**. The `assets/` directory ships
empty, with a README describing the file names the plugin expects.

The user supplies those frames. They are not covered by the MIT license above,
and the authors of this project grant no rights to any likeness, name, identity,
publicity, privacy, trademark or copyright belonging to any person depicted in
material a user chooses to add.
